        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs: clarify aside complementary role mapping]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44629</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44629"/>
        <updated>2026-07-02T23:10:56.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64529428?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Clarifies that <code class="notranslate">&lt;aside&gt;</code> maps to <code class="notranslate">complementary</code> only conditionally when nested in sectioning content.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">This matches the HTML-AAM mapping for <code class="notranslate">&lt;aside&gt;</code> and addresses reader confusion in the <code class="notranslate">&lt;aside&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">complementary</code> role pages.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>HTML-AAM maps <code class="notranslate">&lt;aside&gt;</code> scoped to <code class="notranslate">body</code> or <code class="notranslate">main</code> to <code class="notranslate">complementary</code>.</li>
<li>HTML-AAM maps <code class="notranslate">&lt;aside&gt;</code> scoped to sectioning content to <code class="notranslate">complementary</code> only when it has an accessible name; otherwise it maps to <code class="notranslate">generic</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Validation:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">git diff --check</code></li>
<li>source guard for the new conditional role wording</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #40664.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3300870556" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40664" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40664/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40664">#40664</a></p>]]></content>
