    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[refactor(filecheck): drop `index.html` support and `fs-extra`]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44608</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44608"/>
        <updated>2026-06-30T15:35:42.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Refactor the filecheck script:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Remove <code class="notranslate">index.html</code> support, so only the adjacent <code class="notranslate">index.md</code> is considered when checking whether an attachment is referenced.</li>
<li>Replace <code class="notranslate">fs-extra</code> with <code class="notranslate">node:fs/promises</code> and drop the dependency.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">All documents migrated to <code class="notranslate">index.md</code> long ago, so the <code class="notranslate">index.html</code> fallback is dead code. <code class="notranslate">node:fs/promises</code> covers everything we used <code class="notranslate">fs-extra</code> for, so the extra dependency is no longer needed.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Test fixtures are consolidated into a single <code class="notranslate">md</code> directory, dropping the now-redundant duplicate "not mentioned" test.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">fse.exists</code> → a small <code class="notranslate">pathExists</code> helper wrapping <code class="notranslate">fs.access</code>; <code class="notranslate">fse.copyFileSync</code> → <code class="notranslate">fs.copyFile</code>; <code class="notranslate">fse.removeSync</code> → <code class="notranslate">fs.rm(..., { recursive: true, force: true })</code>.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>


]]></content>
